Package: mlweights
Type: Package
Title: Scaling and Checking Survey Weights for Two-Level Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yousef M.", "Nasher", email = "yousefnasher76@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-3704-3149")),
    person("Marwan", "Alqumbaey", email = "marwanalqumbaey@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0004-8688-9556")))
Description: Rescales within-cluster (level-1) survey weights, checks whether
    they are scaled, splits a Demographic and Health Survey final weight into
    cluster and within-cluster weights with the rescaling step included, and
    gives a first-order approximation of how much unscaled level-1 weights
    inflate the cluster variance of a random-intercept logistic model.
URL: https://github.com/Yousef-Nasher/mlweights
BugReports: https://github.com/Yousef-Nasher/mlweights/issues
